  Mandelbulb3D by Jesse (and contributors), maintained by Andreas Maschke and others.

Parts derived from Mandelbulb3D:
- The import of Mandelbulb3D parameter files (.m3p and text parameters) follows the parameter
  layout of Mandelbulb3D's source (TypeDefinitions.pas, FileHandling.pas, HeaderTrafos.pas).
- The formula option memory layout follows CustomFormulas.pas (FillCustomVBufWithVars).
- crates/rmb-core/src/formula/lib/mb3d.mbf is generated from the Mandelbulb3D formula files
  (M3Formulas/*.m3f) by translating their machine code. The formulas were written by the
  Mandelbulb3D authors and many formula contributors (among them Luca GN / DarkBeam, Kali,
  Tglad, msltoe, Buddhi, Jesse and others named in the formula descriptions).
- Built-in formulas such as Integer Power, Real Power, Quaternion, Tricorn, Amazing Box and
  Folding Int Pow follow their Mandelbulb3D definitions (formulas.pas).

The user interface theme follows RWildFire (https://github.com/Ravetracer/RWildFire, LGPL 3.0 or
later) by the same author.

